ing a total of 4 for the 12 month period.","decision_es":"A drop of one grid position for the next race in which the driver competes. One penalty point is imposed, making a total of 4 for the 12 month period.","tipo":"grilla","proxima_carrera":true},{"id":"a3c3365434f9","titulo":"Doc 33 - Infringement - Car 3 - Turn 14 incident with Car 30","url":"https://www.fia.com/system/files/decision-document/2026_mexico_city_grand_prix_-_infringement_-_car_3_-_turn_14_incident_with_car_30_.pdf","publicado":"31.10.26 03:52","piloto":"Max Verstappen","codigo":"VER","sesion":"Free Practice 2","hecho":"Cars 3 and 30 engaged in a series of moves on the entry to turn 12 through to the apex of turn 14.","decision":"A drop of one grid position for the next race in which the driver competes. One penalty point is imposed, making a total of 1 for the 12 month period.","decision_es":"A drop of one grid position for the next race in which the driver competes. One penalty point is imposed, making a total of 1 for the 12 month period.","tipo":"grilla","proxima_carrera":true},{"id":"fe0d75b190f3","titulo":"Doc 32 - Infringement - Car 5 - Covering components","url":"https://www.fia.com/system/files/decision-document/2026_mexico_city_grand_prix_-_infringement_-_car_5_-_covering_components.pdf","publicado":"31.10.26 03:50","piloto":"Gabriel Bortoleto","codigo":"BOR","sesion":"Free Practice 2","hecho":"The floor of Car 5 was transported by team personnel from one side of the garage to the other whilst covered by a large sheet. In addition, team personnel obstructed the view of Car 5 using another sheet while mechanics were working underneath the car.","decision":"The competitor (Audi Revolut F1 Team) is fined €5,000.","decision_es":"The competitor (Audi Revolut F1 Team) is fined €5,000.","tipo":"multa","proxima_carrera":false},{"id":"dedc3ed8c293","titulo":"Doc 22 - Infringement - Car 98 - Released in an unsafe condition","url":"https://www.fia.com/system/files/decision-document/2026_mexico_city_grand_prix_-_infringement_-_car_98_-_released_in_an_unsafe_condition.pdf","publicado":"30.10.26 23:38","piloto":"Freddie Slater","codigo":null,"sesion":"Free Practice 1","hecho":"Car 98 was released with a cooling fan still attached to the intake of the right radiator.","decision":"The competitor (Audi Revolut F1 Team) is fined €7,500.","decision_es":"The competitor (Audi Revolut F1 Team) is fined €7,500.","tipo":"multa","proxima_carrera":false},{"id":"5d6730e2d105","titulo":"Doc 17 - Infringement - Car 77 - PU elements","url":"https://www.fia.com/system/files/decision-document/2026_mexico_city_grand_prix_-_infringement_-_car_77_-_pu_elements.pdf","publicado":"30.10.26 20:52","piloto":"Valtteri Bottas","codigo":"BOT","sesion":"Free Practice 1","hecho":"The following Power Unit elements have been used: 5th Engine (ICE) 5th Turbocharger (TC) 4th Energy Store (ES) 4th Control Electronics Unit (PU-CE) 4th MGU-K","decision":"Drop of 50 grid positions for the next Race in which the driver participates.","decision_es":"Pierde 50 puestos en la grilla","tipo":"grilla","proxima_carrera":true}],"mejoras":{"titulo":"Doc 12 - Car Presentation Submissions","url":"https://www.fia.com/system/files/decision-document/2026_mexico_city_grand_prix_-_car_presentation_submissions.pdf","publicado":"30.10.26 17:00","equipos":[{"equipo":"McLaren Mastercard F1 Team","mejoras":[{"componente":"Cooling Louvres","motivo":"Para este circuito: refrigeración","detalle":"Larger Cooling Louvres To cope with the specific power unit cooling challenges in Mexico, the cooling louvres have been extended forwards and reshaped."}],"leido":true},{"equipo":"Mercedes-AMG PETRONAS F1 Team","mejoras":[],"leido":true},{"equipo":"Oracle Red Bull Racing","mejoras":[{"componente":"Engine Cover","motivo":"Fiabilidad","detalle":"Additional cooling exit louvres To recover cooling mass flow through the radiators, the exit area has been increased by extending the area of the existing louvres and optional louvres further outboard. 2 Sidepod Performance Local Load Revised sidepod and floor to sidepod split line Attached to existing sidepod geometry to improve the flow characteristics below the inlet to the radiator duct gainin"}],"leido":true},{"equipo":"SCUDERIA FERRARI HP","mejoras":[{"componente":"Engine Cover","motivo":"Para este circuito: refrigeración","detalle":"Enlarged rear bodywork exit, additional top sidepod louvre panels Specific to the requirements of the Mexico City circuit, th ese new bodywork exit and additional louvre panels are extending the top end of the engine cooling capacity, at the expense of car efficiency 2 Cooling Louvres"}],"leido":true},{"equipo":"Williams","mejoras":[],"leido":true},{"equipo":"Visa Cash App Racing Bulls","mejoras":[{"componente":"Coke/Engine Cover","motivo":"Para este circuito: refrigeración","detalle":"Larger rear upper exit The main cooling exit at the rear of the bodywork has been enlarged, to increase the available engine cooling to suit the high demands of this circuit."},{"componente":"Cooling Louvres","motivo":"Para este circuito: refrigeración","detalle":"Extended louvre panel options To further extend the cooling range in extreme conditions, an additional forward louvre panel is available which allows for increased airflow through the radiators."}],"leido":true},{"equipo":"Aston Martin Aramco F1 Team","mejoras":[],"leido":true},{"equipo":"TGR HAAS F1 TEAM","mejoras":[],"leido":true},{"equipo":"Audi Revolut F1 Team","mejoras":[],"leido":false},{"equipo":"BWT Alpine F1 Team","mejoras":[{"componente":"Exhaust Tailpipe","motivo":"Fiabilidad","detalle":"Reprofiled exhaust tailpipe vane For Mexico, the tailpipe vane configuration has been trimmed to suit the track’s unique ambient and aerodynamic requirements."}],"leido":true},{"equipo":"Cadillac","mejoras":[],"leido":true}]}},"actualizado":"2026-10-31T04:15:22+00:00","fuentes":{"Jolpica":{"ok":true},"OpenF1":{"ok":true},"FIA":{"ok":true}}}